      "writtenOn": "2021-04-23T11:22:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t know that. So, in order to use qcow2, the entire partition should be passed as a disk, not a partition in a composite? Then we wouldn\u0027t be able to reference the disk via /dev/block/by-name/userdata, which shouldn\u0027t be a big deal.",
